      "nodeLabel": "N1"
    },
    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**How to read**\n- Step to table: writes. Table to step or screen: reads.\n- Table and pipeline cards are live views of sections in the note. Edit the note, not the card.\n- Wireframe callout numbers match the Elements table in each screen section.",
